---
globs: "*.rs"
alwaysApply: false
---
Rust-specific rules (see AGENTS.md for general guidelines):

- Imports at top, use inner names: `use std::time::Instant`
- No `crate::X` in functions, use relative references
- Tests in trailing `mod tests`
- Inline in format macros: `format!("name is {name}")`
- No `unwrap`/`expect` outside tests
- Comments go above attributes
